# decisions/ — project ADRs

Same process as cairn (`decisions/README.md` there): copy `ADR-000-template.md` to
`ADR-NNN-<slug>.md`, status `proposed` → `accepted` via PR, supersede instead of rewriting, never
delete. Agents propose via a note in `log/proposals/` titled `PROPOSAL - ADR-<title>`.

Put an ADR **here** when it binds only this project. If it binds the company (a vendor, a
company-wide rule, a cross-project boundary), it belongs in cairn.

## Observations
- [rule] Only `status: accepted` ADRs are authoritative
- [rule] Project-scoped decisions here; company-scoped decisions in cairn

